      "writtenOn": "2020-08-11T20:02:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there a generic macro that can be used for this instead of having to make it per-board? Would be nice to have a chromebox macro, chromebook macro, and chromeslate or whatever macro that does the right thing most of the time.",
